Create an original mobile app UI mockup for a spontaneous meetup app called “hey!”, showing the Group Info / Attendance screen.

Use the attached meetup-map screen only as general visual inspiration for the app’s overall mood and design system. Do not copy the reference exactly. Create a new layout that clearly feels like part of the same app.

Keep the visual style consistent with the rest of “hey!”:

vivid purple as the primary brand color
soft off-white / light cream background
subtle lavender gradients
large rounded cards
soft shadows
clean, youthful typography
friendly social-app feeling
polished modern mobile UI
playful small purple accent shapes or sparkles where appropriate

Design a portrait smartphone screen.

At the top:

place the current user’s circular avatar in the upper-left
add a small rounded purple control or icon in the upper-right
show a large centered heading: “GROUP INFO”
optionally include a smaller subtitle such as “Coffee Meetup · Today at 3:30 PM”

Below the heading, create a vertical stack of participant attendance cards.

Each participant card should:

be large and highly rounded
include a circular avatar on the left
show the participant’s first name beside or under the avatar
display a large attendance status on the right
use generous spacing and soft shadows

Include approximately four participants with a mix of statuses.

Example statuses:

soft mint-green card with “ATTENDING!”
soft mint-green card with “ATTENDING!”
soft warm-yellow card with “PENDING…”
soft warm-yellow card with “PENDING…”

Keep the green and yellow tones pastel and soft so the purple branding still feels dominant.

Optionally show a small summary near the participant list such as:
“2 attending · 2 pending”

At the bottom of the screen, place a large rounded red “Cancel Meetup” button. The red should feel elegant and slightly muted rather than harsh, while still clearly representing a destructive action.

The overall hierarchy should feel spacious, simple, playful, and premium. The participant cards should be the main visual focus.

This is a static UI concept only. Do not create real attendance controls, participant management, cancellation behavior, navigation, backend logic, or working buttons.

The result should look like a professional high-fidelity mobile app mockup and should feel visually consistent with the purple meetup-map screen while remaining an original interface.
